        "value": 45,
        "min": 5,
        "max": 80,
        "step": 0.5,
        "units": {
          "en": "°C"
        },
        "hint": {
          "en": "Below this the tank is heated to its target temperature, whatever the price. With tank sensors it is the top temperature (the hot water at the tap). Also keeps the water hot enough while away."
